---

<div class="models">
	<div class="model">
		<img class="logo" src="/logos/typesafe.png" alt="TypeSafe" width="40" height="40" />
		<h3>TypeSafe<span>Jev · the default</span></h3>
		<div class="ids"><code>jev-latest</code></div>
		<p>Set <code>TYPESAFE_API_KEY</code> and run.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="model">
		<svg class="logo cf" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Cloudflare"><path fill="currentColor" d={cloudflare}></path></svg>
		<h3>Cloudflare<span>Clef · on Workers AI</span></h3>
		<div class="ids"><code>clef</code><code>clef-flash</code></div>
		<p>The one image templates need.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="model">
		<svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="OpenAI"><path fill="currentColor" d={openai}></path></svg>
		<h3>OpenAI<span>Luna · Decisions API, in beta</span></h3>
		<div class="ids"><code>gpt-6-luna</code></div>
		<p>Set <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> and pick <code>--provider openai</code>.</p>
	</div>
</div>
<p class="more">
	Or any service that speaks the Jev API, such as one you host yourself. Point decide at it with <code>TYPESAFE_BASE_URL</code>. See <a href="/reference/providers/">Providers</a>.
</p>

<style>
	.models {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		margin-top: 56px;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		border-radius: 16px;
		overflow: hidden;
		text-align: left;
	}
	.model {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 14px;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 28px 26px 30px;
		border-left: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
	}
	.model:first-child {
		border-left: 0;
	}
	.logo {
		display: block;
		width: 40px;
		height: 40px;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.cf {
		color: #f38020;
	}
	h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 20px;
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.3;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	h3 span {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 2px;
		font: 400 13px/1.4 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
	}
	.ids {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.ids code {
		padding: 3px 8px;
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-size: 12.5px;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 14.5px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	p code {
		font-size: 0.9em;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.more {
		max-width: 60ch;
		margin: 22px auto 0;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.more a {
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.models {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
		.model {
			border-left: 0;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		}
		.model:first-child {
			border-top: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
